{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1122293-roleplaying-live-from-ropecon-2017","id":1122293,"title":"Roleplaying live from RopeCon 2017","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-29T04:43:56-07:00","id":1122293,"title":"Roleplaying live from RopeCon 2017","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Streaming live from the largest annual roleplaying convention in the Nordics:</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Saturday July 29th:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1 pm EDT</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6 pm CET</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">8 pm local time</span></span><br /> <br /> - A Talk of Darkness<br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Come and join Guest of Honor Monica Valentinelli and operations director Matt M McElroy from Onyx Path, as they meet up with White Wolf lead storyteller Martin Ericsson and game designer Juhana Petterson, for a talk about the world in which all of their careers entwine: The World of Darkness. The game industry and storyteller veterans talk about their love for the lore and share war stories from their respective careers. The talk is moderated by renown cosmologist, writer and role playing enthusiast Syksy R\u00e4s\u00e4nen.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> 2 pm EDT<br /> 7 pm CET<br /> 9 pm local time<br /> <br /> - White Wolf - 50 Shades of Darkness Ericsson Martin<br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Gothic Punk, Personal horror, Blood Opera, Trenchcoats and Katanas, Indiana Jones with Fangs, Blood Porn, Modern Gothic, Progressive Power Fantasy, Gross-out-Bingo and even a PG 13 World of Slight Dimness. Vampire and the World of Darkness setting as a whole has been presented and experienced by it\u2019s players in a myriad interpretations and styles of play over the last 3 decades. Join us for a talk on how all these often conflicting ways to play are (to various degrees) supported in the 850 book canon and the problems and opportunities this range of traditional play-styles and moods offer game-creators, communities and new players.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> ropecon.fi/stream<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13737,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13737-starbaconry","user":"StarbaConry","date":". 07-29-2017, 07:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13737-starbaconry","name":"StarbaConry","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}